{"articleNo":"251763","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=251763&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [DBpia 이용방법 A to Z] 온라인 특강 안내(3.9.~3.24)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.02.24","hit":"10929","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">학부생 및 대학원생들의 학습활동을 지원하고자 실시간 온라인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.2pt\">특강</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">「</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">DBpia </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">이용방법 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">A to Z</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">」</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.3pt\">를</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">안내하오니 많은 참여바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교육대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">학부생 및 대학원생</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">2. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교육일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: 2021.3.9.(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">) ~ 3.24.(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">) </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">12</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">회 진행</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:7px\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">3. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">교육내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong>도서관 학술</strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong>DB </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong>소개</strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong>, DBPIA </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><strong>활용방법 </strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\"><strong>A to Z</strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:257px; margin-right:7px; text-indent:-192.5pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0pt\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">온라인 사전 등록 </span><a data-cke-saved-href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1OF8g2V2_TDIl-_8H1FEWArEfRHcUVcsesBZ0CGkwCC4/viewform?edit_requested=true\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1OF8g2V2_TDIl-_8H1FEWArEfRHcUVcse